{
  "title": "Homelab — Overview",
  "uid": "homelab-overview",
  "tags": ["homelab", "overview"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Public services down",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "count(probe_success{job=\"blackbox_http_probes\"} == 0)", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Hosts down",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "count(probe_success{job=\"blackbox_icmp\"} == 0)", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tunnel up",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "probe_success{job=\"wg_icmp\"}", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Stack down",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "count(up{job=~\"prometheus|loki|n8n|blackbox-exporter\"} == 0)", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "links",
      "title": "Dashboards",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "links": [
        { "title": "Host Overview", "url": "/d/homelab-host-overview", "targetBlank": false },
        { "title": "Service Reachability", "url": "/d/homelab-service-reachability", "targetBlank": false },
        { "title": "WAN & Tunnel", "url": "/d/homelab-wan-tunnel", "targetBlank": false },
        { "title": "Stack Health", "url": "/d/homelab-selfmonitoring", "targetBlank": false },
        { "title": "UPS", "url": "/d/homelab-ups", "targetBlank": false }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "VPS CPU (alloy)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "green", "value": null },
            { "color": "red", "value": 0.95 }
          ]}
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\", job=\"alloy\"}[5m]))" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "VPS memory used",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"alloy\"} - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"alloy\"}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Notes",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "**Homelab technical overview** — Grafana is the admin-only numbers plane (tailnet-only `stats.kogler.si`). Family launchpad = `home.kogler.si` (Homepage). Internal-only names resolve via headscale MagicDNS / Technitium split-horizon; tails `stats/logs/csui/sec/traefik/auto` are VPS-hosted on the vps-obs tailnet edge." }
    }
  ]
}